1443	        // handler, purely by signature -- a handler must declare a
1444	        // `response_sender` parameter, which in practice means the TRT-LLM
1445	        // workers' `@push_egress_capable` decorator. NOT `context`, which every
1446	        // handler accepts and would therefore make this check always true,
